</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p><div>

</div><ix:continuation id="_RevenueFromContractWithCustomerTextBlock-c0_cont_1"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">All of the Group&#8217;s revenues from contracts
with customers are recognized at a point in time.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><b>Trading Gains (Losses)</b></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Trading gains and losses along with interest
revenue fall within the scope of ASC Topic 825,&#160;<i>Financial Instruments</i>.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">Trading gains (losses) consist of realized and
unrealized gains (losses) derived from (i)&#160;managed portfolio trading positions where the Group acts as counterparty to customers&#8217;
trades, and (ii)&#160;marking up the bid/offer spreads on customers&#8217; CFD transactions, and (iii)&#160;trading gains/(losses) from
proprietary TRS trading activities. Trading gains/(losses) is recorded on a trade date basis. <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="c0" continuedAt="lghl_RevenueFromTradingGainsLossesBreakdownTableTextBlock-c0_cont_1" escape="true" name="lghl:RevenueFromTradingGainsLossesBreakdownTableTextBlock" id="ixv-7260">The following table represents trading
gain (loss) breakdown:</ix:nonNumeric></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&#160;</p>

